From: MrPowerGamerBR <git@mrpowergamerbr.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 17:45:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] SparklyPaper: Track each world's MSPT

Keeps 5s/10s/1m tick time windows per ServerLevel.

Ported from SparklyPaper (https://github.com/SparklyPower/SparklyPaper) by
MrPowerGamerBR. SparklyPaper publishes no license file; as a modification of
GPL-3.0 Paper code that SparklyPaper distributes, it is used under GPL-3.0
(see CREDITS.md).

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java b/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
index 0bd30353ac64c5672e388fa07a62cf180d4cdf1d..e8208397ac2af58be26c6f2a09d3d6bef4c1e79b 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
@@ -1820,7 +1820,15 @@ public abstract class MinecraftServer extends ReentrantBlockableEventLoop<TickTa
             profiler.push("tick");
 
             try {
+                long i = Util.getNanos(); // SparklyPaper - track world's MSPT
                 level.tick(haveTime);
+                // SparklyPaper start - track world's MSPT
+                long j = Util.getNanos() - i;
+                // These are from the "tickServer" function
+                level.tickTimes5s.add(this.tickCount, j);
+                level.tickTimes10s.add(this.tickCount, j);
+                level.tickTimes1m.add(this.tickCount, j);
+                // SparklyPaper end
             } catch (Throwable t) {
                 CrashReport report = CrashReport.forThrowable(t, "Exception ticking world");
                 level.fillReportDetails(report);
diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
index d665590195b3c91056a4ee716dcb27c51cec69c6..9ec928ff2d82c9479ee832c85d8d386e2696ae45 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
@@ -608,6 +608,12 @@ public class ServerLevel extends Level implements WorldGenLevel, ServerEntityGet
     }
     // Paper end - chunk tick iteration
 
+    // SparklyPaper start - track world's MSPT
+    public final MinecraftServer.TickTimes tickTimes5s = new MinecraftServer.TickTimes(100);
+    public final MinecraftServer.TickTimes tickTimes10s = new MinecraftServer.TickTimes(200);
+    public final MinecraftServer.TickTimes tickTimes1m = new MinecraftServer.TickTimes(1200);
+    // SparklyPaper end
+
     public ServerLevel(
         final MinecraftServer server,
         final Executor executor,
